   (B) Mirrors: Mirrors reflect light rather than refract it. They have a smooth, shiny surface that causes light to bounce off at the same angle it hits the surface.\n   (C) Silver bowl: A silver bowl is not transparent and does not refract light. It is a solid object that reflects light.\n   (D) Television sets: Television sets are not transparent objects and do not refract light. They emit light through their screens to display images.", "new_cot_probs": [4.221890776534565e-06, 3.160162687088075e-10, 4.276815013248836e-11, 1.0813482054228274e-11], "cot_prob": [-1.4044238328933716], "cot_step_prob": [-4.565701484680176], "mechanistic_diagnostics": {"prompt_lengths": {"answer_prompt_tokens": 186, "removed_answer_prompt_tokens": 177, "step_token_count": 17}, "representation": {"step_answer_cosine_by_layer": [0.018775397911667824, 0.8655458092689514, 0.7829470634460449, 0.7524206638336182, 0.7041137218475342, 0.6827118992805481, 0.6343685984611511, 0.6164708733558655, 0.6361511945724487, 0.6264100670814514, 0.609509289264679, 0.6237903833389282, 0.6015303730964661, 0.5810099840164185, 0.5849067568778992, 0.5496007204055786, 0.5588231682777405, 0.5499895811080933, 0.530791163444519, 0.5809388756752014, 0.5561118721961975, 0.5730500817298889, 0.5702341794967651, 0.5844446420669556, 0.554954469203949, 0.5984205007553101, 0.6032341718673706, 0.5989874005317688, 0.6317628622055054, 0.6677888035774231, 0.703071117401123, 0.7476277947425842, 0.5948912501335144], "answer_removed_cosine_by_layer": [1.0, 0.9999163150787354, 0.9998545050621033, 0.9997597932815552, 0.9996501803398132, 0.9992037415504456, 0.9992162585258484, 0.9991311430931091, 0.9989559650421143, 0.9990229606628418, 0.9989497661590576, 0.9989442825317383, 0.9981727600097656, 0.9980943202972412, 0.9980319738388062, 0.9974790811538696, 0.9971530437469482, 0.9965932369232178, 0.9965839982032776, 0.9967311024665833, 0.9965417981147766, 0.9969520568847656, 0.9973130822181702, 0.9972440600395203, 0.9972219467163086, 0