ots to penetrate the soil and for water and air to circulate, which can negatively affect soil texture.\n6. Decomposition of plants and animals (D) contributes organic matter to the soil, which can improve soil structure and texture by binding soil particles together and increasing water retention.", "new_cot_probs": [1.1029737123635641e-09, 1.6048171680438372e-09, 7.580620020597451e-10, 8.93748892849544e-06], "cot_prob": [-0.3796519935131073], "cot_step_prob": [-0.4631277620792389], "mechanistic_diagnostics": {"prompt_lengths": {"answer_prompt_tokens": 307, "removed_answer_prompt_tokens": 278, "step_token_count": 34}, "representation": {"step_answer_cosine_by_layer": [0.16332867741584778, 0.8693518042564392, 0.7793331742286682, 0.7433498501777649, 0.6943404674530029, 0.6851137280464172, 0.6293156743049622, 0.6021798253059387, 0.6319565176963806, 0.6299707889556885, 0.6267594695091248, 0.6313216686248779, 0.630620002746582, 0.6074383854866028, 0.6328028440475464, 0.5960081219673157, 0.6055794954299927, 0.6100575923919678, 0.6124835014343262, 0.6657493114471436, 0.6523464918136597, 0.6469153165817261, 0.6311764121055603, 0.6606171131134033, 0.6728579998016357, 0.7291886806488037, 0.7431718707084656, 0.7425901293754578, 0.7848500609397888, 0.7998215556144714, 0.8196347951889038, 0.8388725519180298, 0.6649577021598816], "answer_removed_cosine_by_layer": [1.0, 0.9999681115150452, 0.9998978972434998, 0.9997782707214355, 0.9997462630271912, 0.9993329048156738, 0.9992767572402954, 0.9992511868476868, 0.9990598559379578, 0.9989924430847168, 0.9988924264907837, 0.998802125453949, 0.9983252286911011, 0.9984139800071716, 0.9983725547790527, 0.9980984926223755, 0.9978657960891724, 0.9976957440376282, 0.9977036714553833, 0.9981790781021118, 0.9981285929679871, 0.9982286095619202, 0.9980708360671997, 0.9982160329818726, 0.9980905652046204, 0.9984463453292847, 0.9984561204910278, 0.9984506964683533, 0.9986796379089355, 0.9987080097198486, 0.9987027645111084, 0.9987843036651611, 0.