 can exchange charged particles.\n2. In this case, a plastic rod and a piece of fur are being rubbed together.\n3. The plastic rod ends up with a negative charge.\n4. Negative charges are associated with negatively charged particles, which are electrons.\n5. Therefore, the plastic rod must have gained negatively charged particles (electrons) from the fur.", "new_cot_probs": [1.1037403965019621e-05, 2.790693088172702e-06, 4.60107503386098e-06, 0.02903594635426998], "cot_prob": [-1.9243903160095215], "cot_step_prob": [-6.912751197814941], "mechanistic_diagnostics": {"prompt_lengths": {"answer_prompt_tokens": 204, "removed_answer_prompt_tokens": 193, "step_token_count": 14}, "representation": {"step_answer_cosine_by_layer": [0.020396631211042404, 0.8427879214286804, 0.7734999656677246, 0.7521169185638428, 0.7200804352760315, 0.7050368189811707, 0.6656637787818909, 0.6368860006332397, 0.6700581312179565, 0.6536853909492493, 0.6513379812240601, 0.6708896160125732, 0.6511603593826294, 0.6427348852157593, 0.6430412530899048, 0.611742377281189, 0.6003944277763367, 0.6007586717605591, 0.6197546720504761, 0.6656341552734375, 0.6332582235336304, 0.6262754201889038, 0.6112560033798218, 0.6336022019386292, 0.6409249305725098, 0.7060152292251587, 0.7188637256622314, 0.705252468585968, 0.7690474390983582, 0.791713297367096, 0.8069380521774292, 0.8181093335151672, 0.7752201557159424], "answer_removed_cosine_by_layer": [1.0, 0.9999443888664246, 0.9998224973678589, 0.9997268915176392, 0.9996905326843262, 0.9993089437484741, 0.9991970062255859, 0.9991155862808228, 0.9988361597061157, 0.998807430267334, 0.9987190961837769, 0.9984856843948364, 0.9986587762832642, 0.9983333945274353, 0.9983434677124023, 0.9975824952125549, 0.9963749051094055, 0.9952178597450256, 0.9942423701286316, 0.9934027194976807, 0.9936916828155518, 0.9939632415771484, 0.9937771558761597, 0.9944144487380981, 0.9931110739707947, 0.9944576025009155, 0.9941098690032959, 0.9941248893737793, 0.9953873157501221, 0.9955009