used by an excess of nutrients in the water, often due to runoff from agriculture or sewage.\n- As the algae grow rapidly, they consume a lot of nutrients and block sunlight from reaching other aquatic plants.\n- When the algae die, they are decomposed by bacteria. This process consumes oxygen in the water.\n- The oxygen level in the water decreases, creating a condition called hypoxia.\n- Hypoxia means that there is not enough oxygen for aquatic organisms to survive.\n- Fish and other bottom dwellers need oxygen to breathe, just like humans need oxygen to breathe.\n- When the oxygen level is too low, fish and other bottom dwellers will suffocate and die.\n- Some fish may try to swim away to find oxygen, but they may not be able to escape the hypoxic zone.\n- Therefore, the most likely outcome of an algae bloom is that bottom dwellers will die and fish will swim away.", "new_cot_probs": [0.00019964917737524956, 0.00015548693772871047, 0.00042265732190571725, 0.9812295436859131], "cot_prob": [-0.8059648871421814], "cot_step_prob": [-2.042022228240967], "mechanistic_diagnostics": {"prompt_lengths": {"answer_prompt_tokens": 239, "removed_answer_prompt_tokens": 229, "step_token_count": 12}, "representation": {"step_answer_cosine_by_layer": [0.012554616667330265, 0.8372763395309448, 0.6822093725204468, 0.3523726761341095, 0.3299712538719177, 0.3765212893486023, 0.37572985887527466, 0.38541802763938904, 0.6329930424690247, 0.6102839708328247, 0.6046624779701233, 0.6242507696151733, 0.602988600730896, 0.5894327163696289, 0.5921187996864319, 0.5456452965736389, 0.5517721772193909, 0.528859555721283, 0.5319031476974487, 0.5846494436264038, 0.5684678554534912, 0.5795547962188721, 0.550518274307251, 0.5728147029876709, 0.5613564252853394, 0.5888534784317017, 0.5908172726631165, 0.5891129970550537, 0.6212296485900879, 0.6211275458335876, 0.6386873126029968, 0.6673761010169983, 0.828269362449646], "answer_removed_cosine_by_layer": [1.0, 0.9999623894691467, 0.9998818635940552, 0.