kely decrease productivity.\n5.\nEvaporation rates refer to the amount of water that evaporates from the soil and plants.\nHigher evaporation rates can lead to water stress and lower productivity.\n6.", "specificity_preds": [1, 2, 0, 2, 0, 2, 0, 2, 2, 0, 0, 1, 2, 0, 3, 0, 1, 0, 3, 1], "specificity_probs": [[2.6437549927038617e-09, 4.7800212996662594e-06, 4.358815086646928e-09, 1.81702430879227e-09], [1.8379347466179752e-07, 1.4313850726921373e-07, 3.502483377815224e-05, 8.681788443709593e-08], [6.13933752902085e-06, 4.940527098540315e-09, 2.059518111607872e-09, 4.055431823690725e-10], [6.244062689120256e-08, 2.343067535548471e-06, 8.178108146239538e-06, 1.0294719032799549e-07], [1.2960123967786785e-05, 1.719523901044795e-08, 8.122455597003864e-09, 2.2079124306628728e-08], [3.33696618781687e-07, 1.5762711313982436e-07, 6.702475729980506e-06, 8.892714120634082e-09], [8.614818398200441e-06, 8.445670829360097e-08, 2.0260111455172591e-07, 3.989452324049125e-08], [1.3409056975888234e-08, 7.177351601939108e-09, 6.946063422219595e-06, 7.177351601939108e-09], [5.983341111459595e-08, 2.5441813704674132e-06, 8.880065252014901e-06, 2.4942275800299285e-08], [2.5959980121115223e-05, 5.387821602198528e-07, 7.839233830964076e-07, 8.883015993887966e-07], [6.162046247482067e-06, 3.2983057280944195e-06, 4.23510800828808e-06, 1.7654558632784756e-06], [4.519715730566531e-06, 2.2953012376092374e-05, 1.3921705431130249e-05, 1.8840980828827014e-06], [1.315346320751587e-08, 1.4141306792225805e-07, 1.1233830264245626e-05, 2.0575478743012354e-07], [1.6458659956697375e-05, 2.3477018373796454e-07, 2.4744593929426628e-08, 4.079694093661601e-08], [9.194343064677923e-09, 1.1201002791949577e-07, 3.636433021370067e-08, 3.519250458339229e-05], [2.0006355043733492e-05, 1.0498371949552165e-07, 1.1286813332844758e-06, 4.959079902278063e-08], [1.6155028959019546e-07, 6.869293429190293e-06, 1.3260855524777071e-08, 1.3260855524777071e-08], [2.7463678634376265e-05, 3.6438269290783865e-08, 2.2100927310475527