ions for the offspring are Rr (round seeds) and rr (wrinkled seeds).\n6.", "specificity_preds": [1, 2, 0, 2, 0, 2, 0, 2, 2, 0, 0, 1, 2, 0, 3, 0, 1, 0, 3, 1], "specificity_probs": [[3.265731720603071e-06, 0.0031604948453605175, 4.193282620690297e-06, 2.543354412409826e-06], [1.277655792364385e-05, 3.064937118324451e-05, 0.008498220704495907, 2.7047975891036913e-05], [0.0014890721067786217, 1.6542097000638023e-05, 2.238729393866379e-06, 3.0297908892862324e-07], [1.5123421690077521e-05, 0.001542631071060896, 0.0069135925732553005, 9.861709986580536e-05], [0.00846152938902378, 4.4402033381629735e-05, 6.00916155235609e-06, 3.458033825154416e-05], [0.00010556123743299395, 6.402612052625045e-05, 0.0039611561223864555, 7.646829544682987e-06], [0.008312240242958069, 9.234064782503992e-05, 0.00011856773198815063, 2.9978618840686977e-05], [4.731517947220709e-06, 6.884317826916231e-06, 0.006662473082542419, 1.651461934670806e-05], [1.914919812406879e-05, 0.0006341343396343291, 0.006016499362885952, 1.914919812406879e-05], [0.004891816060990095, 8.959673868957907e-05, 6.15788740105927e-05, 0.00018967629875987768], [0.0027034394443035126, 0.0021054407116025686, 0.0021054407116025686, 0.0009945398196578026], [0.00045686698285862803, 0.0043346332386136055, 0.002629088005051017, 0.00045686698285862803], [1.4137071957520675e-05, 9.218529157806188e-05, 0.02255699783563614, 0.0002505855809431523], [0.008400593884289265, 0.00015386224549729377, 2.0822990336455405e-05, 2.3595539460075088e-05], [9.357053727399034e-07, 1.0059779924631584e-05, 1.0602931297398754e-06, 0.004058405291289091], [0.004008064046502113, 2.7006126401829533e-05, 5.717196472687647e-05, 6.025880793458782e-06], [4.470886051421985e-05, 0.006635382771492004, 6.856325398985064e-06, 9.97589359030826e-06], [0.013864198699593544, 5.66598137083929e-05, 1.264251386601245e-05, 5.971900463919155e-06], [3.878905044985004e-05, 0.0001969870791072026, 6.740527169313282e-06, 0.0065233162604272366], [4.184244062344078e-06, 0.0040494082